  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>i</mi></math>,</p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mover><mi>z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover></mfenced><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>5</mn></msup></math></p><p>Applying binomial expansion we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>0</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>5</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>5</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>4</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>5</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>1</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>32</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>8</mn><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>81</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>244</mn></math></p></blockquote>"
